{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123546","id":4547192547,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDwim4w","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123546","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123546.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123546.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123546","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123546/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123546/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123546/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b1ff97c532b44d66f897de5a3bd8f149965ad7e3","number":123546,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix ClassDB default property value race condition.","user":{"login":"exaltedo2","id":173569997,"node_id":"U_kgDOClh3zQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173569997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2","html_url":"https://github.com/exaltedo2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #111039\r\n\r\n`ClassDB::class_get_default_property_value()` calculates a class's default property values upon the first call and writes them to two static structures: `default_values` and `default_values_cached`. It does not acquire any locks, whereas 66 other functions in the same file acquire a `Locker::Lock`. In other words, ClassDB was designed to use locking, but this specific subsystem was left out, and the function is called from worker threads. Property defaults are resolved when a resource is being registered/imported. Consequently, if two fonts are imported simultaneously, two threads enter this function at the same time.\r\n\r\nThe two independent backtraces in #111039 point to a crash in this exact function.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nHow to fix it:\r\n\r\nWe need to add the locking code at the beginning of the function, just like the other 66 functions in the file:\r\n`Locker::Lock lock(Locker::STATE_WRITE);`\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\nTested on Windows only.\r\n\r\nAI disclosure\r\nI found the bug using Claude, and it provided the solution directly; since it was just a single line of code, there wasn't much for me to do regarding the fix itself. I handled the verification and testing.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godo